      "text": "A thumbnail of 'Table 1: Summary of WHO Position Papers - Recommendations for Routine Immunization', a blue-framed table with columns for antigen, children, adolescents, adults and considerations. Listed among the WHO guidance this kit draws on; the accompanying text describes it as summarising recommended routine immunizations for all age groups.",
